<mxCell id="c30" value="BM25 = idf × saturated term frequency with length normalization; Elasticsearch / Lucene defaults k1 = 1.2, b = 0.75. Exact tokens (a product code, an error string) are BM25&#x27;s strength; a paraphrase with no shared token is its miss." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="362" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
